      "message": "Hrm. I never fully understood why the blocked reason tracepoint was in ttwu instead of near the code that dequeues the blocked task - so initially this makes more sense.  But I also wonder if the cost of stack walk here might be more problematic here when we hold the rqlock?\n\nThis change looks intreaging but I need to probably dig a bit more to better understand the impact of the change properly (also its a bummer having it effectively duplicate the sched_switch tracepoint).",
